────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This MIT License applies to the FLOW ISA SDK distributed in this repository:

  include/flow/isa/      — SDK-stable plugin interface headers
  sdk/cmake/             — FlowPlugin.cmake build helpers
  sdk/docs/              — Plugin authoring documentation
  sdk/templates/         — Starter plugin templates
  sdk/examples/          — Worked example ISA plugins

These are the headers and helpers that ISA plugin authors compile against.
Plugins you build against this SDK are your own independent work and carry
no license obligations beyond this MIT notice.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ENGINE BINARY
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Every release archive in this repository also includes pre-built FLOW engine
binaries:

  flow.exe / flow            — Instruction stream generator CLI
  flow_validate.exe / flow_validate
                             — Script validator CLI

These binaries are NOT covered by the MIT License above. They are proprietary
and governed by the separate Binary License — see LICENSE-BIN.

The engine source code is proprietary and is not distributed here.
